# Software industry mapping for CMS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/cms/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:developer_doc_content owl:equivalentClass sw:DeveloperDocContent .
legacy:developer_doc_content_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:developerDocContentId .
legacy:api_documentation_page owl:equivalentClass sw:ApiDocumentationPage .
legacy:api_documentation_page_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:apiDocumentationPageId .
legacy:publishes_developer_doc rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:publishesDeveloperDoc .
